# SEO Audit Command

When the user says **"run SEO audit"**, **"seo audit"**, **"run search audit"**, or **"search SEO audit"**:

## What to do

1. Launch one subagent (generalPurpose) and instruct it to follow `docs/process/seo-audit-process.md`.
2. Require output report at `docs/audits/seo/YYYY-MM-DD-seo-audit.md`.
3. Audit only. Do not make code changes.
4. After completion, summarize top findings and report location.

## References

- Process: `docs/process/seo-audit-process.md`
- Reports: `docs/audits/seo/`
